# 4. Task Manager Performance Troubleshooting

### Scenario

User reports:

> "My computer is extremely slow."

### Troubleshooting Process

```text
Ask questions
        ↓
Determine when the issue started
        ↓
Ask about recent changes
        ↓
Open Task Manager
        ↓
Check CPU
        ↓
Check Memory
        ↓
Check Disk
        ↓
Check Network
        ↓
Review running processes
        ↓
Check Startup applications
        ↓
Identify abnormal resource usage
        ↓
Apply authorized fix
        ↓
Verify with user
        ↓
Document / Escalate
```

### Important

Processes should not be terminated simply because they appear unfamiliar.

Before ending a process, determine what it does and whether stopping it could affect the system or another application.

