# 5. Windows Startup Applications

Startup applications are programs configured to start automatically when Windows starts.

They can be reviewed through Task Manager.

### Help Desk Relevance

Too many unnecessary startup applications can contribute to:

* Slow boot times
* Increased resource usage
* Slower system performance

Any changes should follow company policy.

