# 6. Active Directory User Management

Active Directory Users and Computers (ADUC) can be used by authorized administrators to manage domain user accounts.

Common administrative tasks include:

* Creating users
* Resetting passwords
* Unlocking accounts
* Disabling accounts
* Enabling accounts
* Managing group membership

